  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Full pymnt - UNWOMEN RSA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project titled &quot;Scaling up Institutional Response to Violence Against Women and Girls &quot; aims to address the persistently high rates of GBV in South Africa and Lesotho. The project seeks to mobilize diverse partnerships, including CBOs and other CSOs, government departments, and the private sector, to foster egalitarian social norms and advance gender equality. Key interventions include capacity development for the South African Police Service on gender-sensitive approaches and trauma management, community engagement through HeForShe dialogues, the involvement of faith and traditional leaders and improving access to comprehensive services for GBV survivors.</narrative>
  </description>
